  <title>v14 "The Proper One"</title>
  
<text xml:space="preserve"><note-content version="0.1"><underline>v14 "The Proper One"</underline>

<bold>#v13 fixed error:</bold>
<bold>daniel:~/downloads/mpdamp/0.1-alpha-v13/mpdamp-0.1-alpha-v13-fixed$ ./mpdamp.py</bold>
<bold>Traceback (most recent call last):</bold>
  <bold>File "/mnt/500G/downloads/mpdamp/0.1-alpha-v13/mpdamp-0.1-alpha-v13-fixed/./mpdamp.py", line 951, in &lt;module&gt;</bold>
    <bold>MPDAmp().mainloop()</bold>
    <bold>~~~~~~^^</bold>
